        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\n\nTHREE BEDROOM DUPLEX IN BALBRIGGAN\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings s are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom duplex residence to the rental market, ideally positioned on the quiet and highly sought-after Bremore Pastures Way in Balbriggan, Co. Dublin.\n\nThis bright and spacious home offers character and comfort throughout, with own-door access and generous accommodation arranged over two levels. The first floor features a large open-plan lounge and kitchen with excellent natural light, along with access to both a front balcony and a rear patio. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms — two doubles and one single — including one with an ensuite, as well as a main bathroom.\n\nBalbriggan offers a fantastic mix of convenience and coastal living, with the beach, harbour, and train station all within a short walk. Schools, cafés, and everyday amenities are close by, and Castlemill Shopping Centre sits right beside the development for effortless access to shops and services. It's an area that blends practicality with a relaxed seaside feel, giving tenants everything they need within easy reach.\n\nKey Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Quiet cul-de-sac location</li>\n <li>Communal parking</li>\n <li>Balcony to the front</li>\n <li>Three bedrooms</li>\n <li>Fully furnished</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
